# Project Governance & Agent Contracts

Strictly follow all rules and procedures defined in `@CLAUDE.md`.

## Execution Rules

1. At session start, run `zeo orient --json` and follow the returned protocol.
2. Before declaring any code/SOW task finished or submitting a commit, run:
   `make verify` (or `zeo <path>` on the changed paths).
3. Never bypass a failing gate or ignore `zeo` warnings/errors.
4. Obey SOW frontmatter rules (`schema_rev: 17`, `status:`, `restaufwand:`, `done_when:`).
5. Do not mutate historical SOW bodies or closed rulings.
6. Never hand-author SOW/intake YAML; use `zeo intake promote` for grounded promotion.
